Title: GPU arm on padme: same cells, and what auto actually selects
Created: 2026-08-29
Author: claude
Closed: delivered by PR #100: auto observed (cuda,webgpu,cpu — CUDA-dominant, per-model crash for granite under auto), fp16 unreliable two ways, X8 byte-identical at every shared rung, projections superseded. Wall-clock bound deliberately unpinned: throughput anomaly filed as ticket 0481

